处理存在缺陷，当移位长度超过表达式大小时未能正确处理，导致生成的 RSA 密钥可能不符合预期强度。该漏洞影响运行在 64 位 HP-UX 平台上的 OpenSSL，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此缺陷绕过加密保护机制，通过触发不正确的 RSA 密钥生成来削弱系统加密强度，从而更容易破解加密通信或伪造数字签名。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1254"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2016-05-05T01:59:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27Z","remediation":"升级 OpenSSL 至 0.9.6 或更高版本，以修复 crypto/rsa/rsa_gen.c 在 64 位 HP-UX 平台上处理位运算移位时导致的 RSA 密钥生成缺陷。如暂无法升级，可临时在防火墙层禁用相关 SSL/TLS 服务，或避免在 64 位 HP-UX 系统上运行受影响版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=openssl-users&m=95961024500509","http://www-01.ibm.com/support/docview.wss?uid=swg21995039","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2016/05/04/17","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/90109","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1035750","https://git.openssl.org/?p=openssl.git%3Ba=commit%3Bh=db82b8f9bd432a59aea8e1014694e15fc457c2bb","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1254.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dfd3785ea0ca532d9efd1c0b17520a18e47b035b/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1254.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1254.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/cb915da527ff1f7ae59c6e959143aa27dc42dc24/vex/cve/2000/CVE-2000-1254.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1254","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1254.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2000-1254","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2000/CVE-2000-1254.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2000-1254","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1254.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0855.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1171","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1171.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1247","title":"Apache JServ jserv-status处理器配置错误漏洞","description":"Apache JServ 1.1.2 的 jserv.conf 配置文件中，jserv-status 处理器的默认配置包含 \"allow from 127.0.0.1\" 行，导致本地用户可通过直接向 jserv/ URI 发送请求来获取 JDBC 密码或其他敏感信息。该漏洞源于不安全的默认访问控制配置，攻击者只需拥有本地访问权限即可利用，无需认证。CVSS 评分 2.1，危害等级低，但可能导致数据库凭据泄露，进而引发更严重的安全问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1247"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2011-10-05T02:56:24Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27Z","remediation":"修改 jserv.conf 中 jserv-status 处理器配置，移除或注释掉 \"allow from 127.0.0.1\" 行，或将其替换为 \"deny from all\" 以完全禁用远程访问。建议升级至 Apache Tomcat（Apache JServ 已停止维护），并限制对 /jserv/ 路径的访问，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 访问状态页面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archive.apache.org/dist/java/java.apache.org-www.tar.gz","http://marc.info/?l=java-apache-users&m=97036799917909&w=2","http://securityreason.com/securityalert/8412","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/51946","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1247.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1247.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1247","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1247.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1247.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/14d874e761633e61e3b45458431a87e35478bd2b/2000/CVE-2000-1247.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/67c5e994e49225faeedb88198d627dbdd922374c/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1247.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1247.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/338375e9291959a955b9c4f1b7794c4836fe2985/tracker/CVE/2000/CVE-2000-1247.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1247.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1171.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-1171.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1171.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1170","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1170.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1246","title":"Novell NetWare FTP 服务器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare 5.1 SP3 及更早版本中的 FTP 服务器组件 NWFTPD.nlm（低于 5.01o 版本）存在拒绝服务漏洞。当远程已认证用户先发送 RNFR 命令并故意使其失败（如指定不存在的源文件路径），随后紧接着发送 RNTO 命令时，服务器未能正确恢复或清理前序命令失败后的内部状态，导致异常终止（abend）。攻击者需首先通过 FTP 身份认证，具备基本的 FTP 操作权限，在目标网络可达的前提下即可发起攻击，造成 FTP 服务中断，影响合法用户对文件传输服务的正常使用。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 3.5，危害等级较低。","severity":"LOW","score":3.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1246"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2010-04-05T15:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27Z","remediation":"升级 NWFTPD.nlm 到 5.01o 或更高版本，应用 Novell 发布的 NetWare 5.1 SP3 安全补丁包。如暂时无法升级，可关闭 FTP 服务或通过防火墙限制仅允许可信内网 IP 访问 21 端口，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/support/viewContent.do?externalId=3238588&sliceId=1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1246.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1246.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1246","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1246.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1246.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1246.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a121c9678feb15c776e19eb9a2198be3c8093209/2000/CVE-2000-1246.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1246.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1246.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1246.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1170.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1169","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1169.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1245","title":"Novell NetWare FTP 服务 访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"Novell NetWare 5.1 SP3 的 FTP 服务器组件 NWFTPD.nlm 在 5.01o 之前版本中存在多个未明确说明的访问控制漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过未知攻击向量绕过对匿名访问的预期限制，以匿名用户身份执行未经授权的 FTP 操作。该漏洞影响 Novell NetWare 5.01i 及 5.1 等版本，攻击者无需账号凭证即可在互联网或局域网内直接发起利用，导致敏感文件泄露、数据篡改或服务中断，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1245"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2010-04-05T15:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:27Z","remediation":"建议将 NetWare 5.1 升级至 Service Pack 8 并安装 NWFTPD.NLM v5.05，或至少将 NWFTPD.NLM 升级至 5.01o 及以上版本以修复匿名访问控制绕过漏洞。同时修改 SYS:ETC\\FTPSERV.CFG 配置文件，将 ANONYMOUS_ACCESS 设置为 NO 以禁用匿名 FTP 登录，并删除匿名用户账户。配置 SYS:ETC\\FTPREST.TXT 访问控制列表，使用 NOREMOTE 限制禁止远程用户访问敏感目录，确保匿名密码符合 x@y 格式要求。如暂无法升级，可在防火墙层阻断 21 端口入站访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.novell.com/support/viewContent.do?externalId=3238588&sliceId=1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1e49eca35d3056672c77df905c5c125f371b8ebb/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1245.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0b6e820f75229c8af13f7ed779288022b3112db2/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1245.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/SSVC/data/2000/CVE-2000-1245.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1cf21dc2c185a3301ffa683a942c44c61b3a4b1e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1245.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1245","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1245.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1245.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1245.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ce2c8661ffd3fb6a28ed59c3d877961640a570d4/2000/CVE-2000-1245.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a34babb9031dd723054cf90c4f7fb7c79c3ea176/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1245.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1169.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0937","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0937.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1208","title":"NetBSD lpr/lpd 打印服务格式字符串本地权限提升漏洞","description":"BSD 系统 lpr/lpd 打印服务存在格式字符串漏洞，位于 printjob.c 文件中 startprinting() 函数的 syslog 调用不当，直接使用了来自 checkremote() 函数的格式化字符串参数。本地低权限用户可通过构造包含格式说明符的特制输入触发该漏洞，向系统日志输出恶意数据并篡改内存，从而获取 root 级别权限。该漏洞影响基于 BSD 的 lpr/lpd 软件包，攻击者需具备本地访问权限即可利用，CVSS v3 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者可借此实现对目标系统的完全控制，进而进一步渗透内网或横向移动。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1208"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23Z","remediation":"建议更新 NetBSD 系统至已修复该漏洞的安全版本。对于仍在使用旧版 lpd 服务的系统，应修改 printjob.c 中的 startprinting() 函数，将 syslog() 调用改为使用固定格式字符串（如 syslog(LOG_ERR, \"%s\", message)）以消除格式化字符串漏洞，或直接禁用不必要的 lpd 服务以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96994604300675&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/137555","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/5286.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-066.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1711","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1208.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1208","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/22bf0a843f1870af65d30413f104d6fa91f5e1f4/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1208.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1208.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/60d4dcdd76d8e53a83b4df7025d6bb3623e1d439/2000/CVE-2000-1208.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1208.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1208.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/6ffe41ed17f28a5cc4ca179538df7b0072158276/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1208.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1208.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/67f0cd4c1596148edc70751caa01ad7684d5c638/content/CVE-2000-1208.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0937.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0844","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0844.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1209","title":"Microsoft SQL Server sa 账户默认空密码远程权限提升漏洞","description":"Microsoft SQL Server 2000、SQL Server 7.0 及 MSDE 1.0 中 \"sa\" 系统管理员账户在默认安装时密码为空，远程攻击者可通过空密码直接登录数据库系统，获取数据库管理员权限，进而执行任意 SQL 命令、创建账户、读取或篡改数据，实现完全控制数据库服务器。该漏洞已被 Voyager Alpha Force 和 Spida 等蠕虫广泛利用，影响范围包括使用这些数据库产品的第三方软件包如 Tumbleweed Secure Mail、Compaq Insight Manager 和 Visio 2000 等。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1209"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2002-08-12T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23Z","remediation":"立即为 SQL Server 的 sa 账户设置强密码（至少 12 位含大小写字母、数字和特殊字符），使用 ALTER LOGIN sa ENABLE; ALTER LOGIN sa WITH PASSWORD = '<强密码>' 命令执行。同时禁用 sa 账户或改用 Windows 身份验证模式，在 SQL Server Management Studio 中设置\"仅 Windows 身份验证\"。对于已停止支持的 SQL Server 2000/7.0/MSDE 1.0，建议迁移至 SQL Server 2019 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96333895000350&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96593218804850&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96644570412692&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/273639","http://security-archive.merton.ox.ac.uk/bugtraq-200008/0233.html","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ313418","http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3BEN-US%3Bq321081","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/1459.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/635463","http://www.microsoft.com/security/security_bulletins/ms02020_sql.asp","http://www.osvdb.org/3570","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4797","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16394","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1209.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9c6bb4d80b2633b04c3d95cd11fee4b8b1b012c2/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1209.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1209","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2000/CVE-2000-1209.rules","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/559ec87f609d31af7a4580139706f217d81d7a2e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1209.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1209.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1209.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1209.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1209.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/7b0091a6728c321d97febad01bf502be7a113020/config/msf_cve-db.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0844.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1149","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1149.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1210","title":"Apache Tomcat 目录遍历任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 3.1 之前版本中的 source.jsp 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 source.jsp 参数传入 `..`（点点）序列实现路径穿越，从而读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞源于对用户输入的文件路径缺乏充分的过滤与校验，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，影响机密性。受影响的版本包括 Apache Tomcat 3.1 之前的所有版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1210"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2002-03-22T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat 至 3.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 source.jsp 中未对用户输入进行路径过滤的问题。如无法升级，可删除或限制 source.jsp 的访问权限，并在 Web 服务器层面对包含 \"..\" 的 URL 请求进行拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95371672300045&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/4205.php","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2000/CVE-2000-1210.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1210.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/GHSA/data/2000/CVE-2000-1210.json","https://github.com/p0dalirius/ApacheTomcatScanner/blob/af5077ce3aeae4c7df3be909998bb54e3812c742/apachetomcatscanner/data/vulnerabilities/2000/CVE-2000-1210.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1210.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1210","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1210.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1210.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-1210.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1210.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1149.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1150","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1150.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1215","title":"Lotus Domino 服务器 HTTP 响应头信息泄露漏洞","description":"Lotus Domino 服务器 5.0.8 版本的默认配置会在 HTTP 响应头中包含系统信息（版本号、操作系统类型和构建日期），导致敏感信息泄露。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送 HTTP 请求并检查响应头获取这些信息，为进一步攻击收集目标环境情报。该漏洞影响 Lotus Domino 5.0.8 及可能的相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议升级至更高版本或修改配置以移除响应头中的系统信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1215"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-09-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:23Z","remediation":"升级至 Lotus Domino 5.0.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 HTTP 响应头信息泄露问题。如无法立即升级，可在前端部署反向代理服务器过滤响应头中的 Server/X-Powered-By 等敏感信息字段。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100094373621813&w=2","http://www-10.lotus.com/ldd/r5fixlist.nsf/5c087391999d06e7852569280062619d/5552251934afaa9585256c0000737a7f?OpenDocument&Highlight=0%2CAWHN4A8QWM","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/984555","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10685","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1215.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1215.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1215","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1215.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1215.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7ed8df0083f452d49c6e50d6c61a40c3f4b97ff9/2000/CVE-2000-1215.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1215.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/12065efa5942c8c399e6c39fc2649ac2e94409b9/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1215.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1215.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2000-1215.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-1150.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1150.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-1144","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-1144.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-1202","title":"IBM IBMHSSSB 1.0 代码执行漏洞","description":"IBM HTTP Server SSL 模块 (IBMHSSSB) 1.0 版本中的 ikeyman 组件存在 CLASSPATH 环境变量配置不当漏洞。该组件将用户自定义的 CLASSPATH 目录置于系统目录之前，导致本地恶意用户可通过植入木马 Ikeyman 类文件，在以 root 权限运行 ikeyman 时实现任意代码执行并提权至 root。该漏洞影响 IBM HTTP Server SSL 模块 1.0 版本，CVSS 评分 7.2（高危），攻击向量为本地，需低权限用户交互，可完全破坏系统机密性、完整性和可用性。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-1202"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:22Z","remediation":"升级 IBM HTTP Server SSL Server Bundle (IBMHSSSB) 至修复版本或应用 IBM 官方安全补丁（参考 BID 1092/X-Force 4235），修正 ikeyman 组件的 CLASSPATH 环境变量排序问题，确保系统目录优先于用户目录；若无法立即升级，可通过限制本地用户写入权限、移除用户自定义 CLASSPATH 路径或禁用 ikeyman 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/54073","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1092","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4235","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1202.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dd1c73c7d44a762cc5a69d15ad07fe20976d7aec/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-1202.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-1202","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-1202.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-1202.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e60bb3a306b43cc668d535cff411b9566d5ecc1b/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-12xx/CVE-2000-1202.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/94607cd5f476edf9a266e633e1be7e43ab890e1c/2000/CVE-2000-1202.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/aa26e43cea95c9f8fa4c03fce1cced7c702a4035/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1202.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1202.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/1xxx/CVE-2000-1202.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-1144.toml"}]